# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3dHome — .gitignore
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. The rules below are a privacy boundary, not just noise
# reduction. Anything describing a real home must never be committed.
# `scripts/check-no-pii.sh` enforces the same boundary in CI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- House profiles --------------------------------------------------------
# Every house is private by default. Only the fictional demo house is public.
# Order matters: the broad ignore must come BEFORE the negation, and the
# directory itself must be re-included before anything inside it can be.
houses/*/
!houses/demo/

# --- Generated / operator config (may contain the HA token) ----------------
config.js
config.json
secrets.json
*secrets*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.*

# --- Planning docs carried over from the private predecessor ---------------
# PLAN.md documents the migration using REAL entity ids, hostnames and LAN
# addresses as examples. It is deliberately never committed here.
PLAN.md

# --- Renders of a real home ------------------------------------------------
.playwright-mcp/
screenshots/

# --- OS / editor noise -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Python (the `python -m http.server` quick-start path) -----------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Local serving staging ---------------------------------------------------
# .serve-ope/ is a throwaway COPY of src/ + index.html + a REAL house profile,
# assembled so a real house can be served locally without that house ever
# living in the repo. It contains private geometry and photographs of someone's
# actual home. It must never be committed. (.serve-ope-sync.sh rebuilds it, and
# names a machine-specific path, so it stays local too.)
.serve-ope/
.serve-ope-sync.sh

# --- comparison harness output ----------------------------------------------
# scripts/compare/ writes screenshots + digests here. Captures of a REAL house,
# so they must never be committed.
.compare-out/
